<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Green Mobility - Sustainable Transportation</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">

        <h1>Green Mobility</h1>

        <h2>Move Smarter. Share Better. Travel Greener.</h2>

        <p>
            A smarter campus mobility platform that helps students
            find sustainable transportation, share rides and track
            their environmental impact.
        </p>

        <a href="index.jsp">
            <button type="button">Get Started</button>
        </a>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="section">

    <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Why Green Mobility?</h2>
        <p>Small transportation choices can create a bigger impact.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">

        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Find a Ride</h3>
            <p>
                Discover available campus transportation based on
                your route and preferred schedule.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Choose Green</h3>
            <p>
                Get access to electric vehicles, bicycles and other
                low-emission transportation options.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Share Your Ride</h3>
            <p>
                Join shared rides with students travelling along
                similar routes.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Track Your Impact</h3>
            <p>
                See your rides, distance travelled and estimated
                CO2 savings over time.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>

<div class="section">

    <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Our Vision</h2>
        <p>Building cleaner mobility, one campus at a time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">

        <h2>Contributing to a Greener India</h2>

        <p>
            Transportation contributes significantly to fuel consumption,
            congestion and carbon emissions. Green Mobility encourages
            students to choose shared, electric and non-motorized
            transportation whenever possible.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            By making sustainable transportation easier to discover,
            book and track, the platform helps turn individual choices
            into measurable environmental contributions.
        </p>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>